1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,920
(Amy:)Human beings form
emotional attachments as they grow up.

2
00:00:03,128 --> 00:00:06,008
ln your case, to your mother,
superheroes, et cetera.

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:08,506
(Amy:)I'm going to attempt an experiment...

4
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:11,427
(Amy:)...that will get you
to transfer those feelings to me.

5
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:13,636
(Sheldon:)Well, seems what's on
the menu tonight...

6
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:17,057
(Sheldon:)...is malarkey
with a big side of poppycock.

7
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:21,936
(Amy:)We'll see. Let's start with
a little romantic dinner music, shall we?

8
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:33,162
l see what you're doing.
You're attempting to build on the work...

9
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,956
(Sheldon:)...of Ebbinghaus by triggering
an involuntary memory...

10
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:37,451
(Sheldon:)...of me playing that game.

11
00:00:37,662 --> 00:00:40,752
(Sheldon:)Admittedly the happiest 600 hours
of my childhood.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,750
(Sheldon:)- But it won't work.
- Fine.

13
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,840
There's no reason we can't have a lovely
dinner. Why don't you have a seat?

14
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:56,680
- May I offer you something to drink?
- You know I don't drink.

15
00:00:56,890 --> 00:01:01,020
(Amy:)Not even Strawberry Quik?

